{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a monster\u2019s cage, your memories erased, with only thirty days remaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four companions, each with their own secrets, are trapped here with you. Some seek escape, others sink into despair\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror game about control and salvation. Within thirty days, you must explore, talk, and choose to piece together the truth and find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you obey the monster\u2019s will, search for the path to freedom, or become its most beloved child?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tA visually immersive, narrative-driven horror experience with simple controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tMultiple characters and branching routes: deepen your bond with each companion to unlock their unique endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tA time system where each day\u2019s actions affect both story progression and outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tMultiple endings based on your choices and relationships.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939020?t=1759572200","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939020?t=1759572200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939020/0ff7ad35a5970152ccbdfb143b8b7982c3d2dc29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759572200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939020/0ff7ad35a5970152ccbdfb143b8b7982c3d2dc29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759572200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a monster\u2019s cage, your memories erased, with only thirty days remaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four companions, each with their own secrets, are trapped here with you. Some seek escape, others sink into despair\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror game about control and salvation. Within thirty days, you must explore, talk, and choose to piece together the truth and find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you obey the monster\u2019s will, search for the path to freedom, or become its most beloved child?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tA visually immersive, narrative-driven horror experience with simple controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tMultiple characters and branching routes: deepen your bond with each companion to unlock their unique endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tA time system where each day\u2019s actions affect both story progression and outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tMultiple endings based on your choices and relationships.</p>","developers":["Zig"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939020/567fea72173ca3c143b4ac15c81c927955e7a72f/header.jpg?t=1759572200","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3939020/670828372/2ea88924f80bf728b7828d2d130a2dbb7836e21d/1759346640/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759347303","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3939020/670828372/2ea88924f80bf728b7828d2d130a2dbb7836e21d/1759346640/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759347303","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3939020/670828372/2ea88924f80bf728b7828d2d130a2dbb7836e21d/1759346640/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=175934